{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109330","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109330/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109330/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109330/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109330","id":3292890347,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7ERYTr","number":109330,"title":"Collision disappears in the scene","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-08-05T12:17:21Z","updated_at":"2025-08-05T12:33:56Z","closed_at":"2025-08-05T12:20:16Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.5.beta4.official [2d113cc22]\n\n### System information\n\narch, linux-x86-64, x11\n\n### Issue description\n\nI encountered this issue after switching from v4.5.beta3.official [4d1f26e] to beta4. At first, the collision just started disappearing — I assumed it was a bug but couldn’t link it to anything specific. Eventually, I figured out that it happens after switching scenes. I can’t say for sure whether this is an engine bug or a project-level issue at this point. But it seems likely that, once again, a missing boolean flag in the engine is causing the collision to be invisible — since other collisions still work as expected.\n\n***\nThere are also other inconsistencies — like scene thumbnails not matching reality, or a texture in the scene tree not being what it actually is in the scene, or materials not corresponding to their real appearance. I’m not sure if I should create a separate issue for these?\n***\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nhttps://youtu.be/KV-hvHDEq8c\n\nI can only provide this video as additional context. And yes, the errors shown in the console are probably unrelated to the actual issue. At the end of the video, you can see how the scene transition itself — without any visible error — breaks the collision rendering.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI can’t share the project, as it is part of a closed/private work.","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gi